<p id="mwBw">The <b id="mwCA">thirtieth season</b> of <i id="mwCQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelor (American TV series)" id="mwCg">The Bachelor</a></i> will premiere on March 21, 2027, after a two-year hiatus following the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_29" title="The Bachelor (American TV series) season 29" id="mwCw">twenty-ninth season</a> featuring <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grant_Ellis" title="Grant Ellis" id="mwDA">Grant Ellis</a>.<sup about="#mwt7" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwDQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEA">]</span></span></a></sup> This season features 27-year-old <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Hartman" title="Sam Hartman" id="mwEQ">Sam Hartman</a>, a professional <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_football" title="American football" id="mwEg">football</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quarterback" title="Quarterback" id="mwEw">quarterback</a> for the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Commanders" title="Washington Commanders" id="mwFA">Washington Commanders</a> from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlotte,_North_Carolina" title="Charlotte, North Carolina" id="mwFQ">Charlotte, North Carolina</a>.<sup about="#mwt10" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwFg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGA">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwGg" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwGw" aria-labelledby="Production"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Production">Production</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Production"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwHA" aria-labelledby="Casting_and_contestants"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Casting_and_contestants">Casting and contestants</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Casting and contestants"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwHQ">Hartman was announced as the Bachelor through an appearance on <i id="mwHg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Good_Morning_America" title="Good Morning America" id="mwHw">Good Morning America</a></i> on November 13, 2026.<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwIA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwJA" aria-labelledby="Filming_and_development"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Filming_and_development">Filming and development</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Filming and development"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwJQ">On February 21, 2025, during the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)_season_29" title="The Bachelor (American TV series) season 29" id="mwJg">twenty-ninth season</a>, current and former crew members of <i id="mwJw">The Bachelor</i> franchise accused <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Showrunner" title="Showrunner" id="mwKA">showrunners</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Executive_producer" title="Executive producer" id="mwKQ">executive producers</a> Claire Freeland and Bennett Graebner of fostering a "hostile" and "toxic" workplace.<sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwKg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLA">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Freeland and Graebner left the franchise in March following the allegations.<sup about="#mwt19" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwLg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwLw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMQ">]</span></span></a></sup> <i id="mwMg">The Bachelor</i> was renewed for a thirtieth season on June 30, 2025, with <i id="mwMw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_TV_series)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American TV series)" id="mwNA">Bachelor in Paradise</a></i> executive producer Scott Teti serving as its new showrunner.<sup about="#mwt22" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwNQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwNg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNw">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwOQ">Following an abrupt cancellation on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_22" title="The Bachelorette (American TV series) season 22" id="mwOg">twenty-second season</a> of <i id="mwOw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelorette (American TV series)" id="mwPA">The Bachelorette</a></i> in March 2026,<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mwPQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPw">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">]</span></span></a></sup> filming for <i id="mwQQ">The Bachelor</i> is expected to begin in January 2027, following the conclusion of the regular <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_NFL_season" title="2026 NFL season" id="mwQg">2026 NFL season</a>.<sup about="#mwt28" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-8" id="mwQw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRQ">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRg">]</span></span></a></sup> It is speculated <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor_Frankie_Paul" title="Taylor Frankie Paul" id="mwRw">Taylor Frankie Paul</a> wanted the job as a contestant on the series (presumably a celebrity).<sup about="#mwt31" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-9" id="mwSA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwSQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSg">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt34" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwTA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwTQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTg">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

